<p style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">As of <a data-tblloc="5x1" data-tblname="857630" data-tblv="62" id="led857630F2026611782929629906">June 30, 2026</a>, Expro&#8217;s consolidated cash and cash equivalents, including restricted cash, totaled $200&nbsp;million, and the Company&#8217;s total liquidity&nbsp;stood at $492 million. Total liquidity includes $292&nbsp;million&nbsp;available for drawdowns as loans under the Company&#8217;s revolving credit facility. The Company had outstanding long-term borrowings of $79&nbsp;million&nbsp;as of&nbsp;<a data-tblloc="5x1" data-tblname="857630" data-tblv="62" id="led857630F2026611782929758520">June 30, 2026</a>.</p>

