<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">On April 1, 2026, Expro&#8217;s Board of Directors unanimously approved a plan to change the Company&#8217;s corporate domicile from the Netherlands to the Cayman Islands (the &#8220;Redomicile&#8221;). The proposals related to the Redomicile were approved by a shareholder vote during the Company&#8217;s Annual Shareholder Meeting on June 10, 2026. The Redomicile was completed on July 13, 2026.</p>

<p style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; margin: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p>
