<p style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">On July 23, 2026, Expro closed on the acquisition of Enhanced Drilling. Under the terms of the agreement Expro purchased Enhanced Drilling for approximately 2 billion Norwegian kroner (&#8220;NOK&#8221;) in cash (approximately $215&nbsp;million) plus customary closing and working capital adjustments.</p>

